msgid "robot_action_composer"
msgstr "robot_action_composer"

msgid "Motion generation and **task_queue** YAML orchestration: a skill registry turns YAML blocks into **`StageTarget`** sequences and runs them through **`ROS2RobotInterface`**. Optional LeRobot dataset recording is an extra, not the core path."
msgstr "运动生成与 **task_queue** YAML 编排：技能注册表把 YAML 块变成 **`StageTarget`** 序列，再通过 **`ROS2RobotInterface`** 执行。可选的 LeRobot 数据集录制是 extra，不是核心路径。"

msgid "Documented branch"
msgstr "文档所依据的分支"

msgid "Documented against branch `feature/dex-grasp-generator` (tip 2026-09-20). That branch is newer than `main`; follow it, not `main`."
msgstr "本文档对照分支 `feature/dex-grasp-generator`（尖端提交 2026-09-20）。该分支新于 `main`；请以它为准，不要跟 `main`。"

msgid "**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer @ `feature/dex-grasp-generator`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/tree/feature/dex-grasp-generator)"
msgstr "**仓库：** [fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer @ `feature/dex-grasp-generator`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/tree/feature/dex-grasp-generator)"

msgid "**README:** [README.md on this branch](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/README.md)"
msgstr "**README：** [README.md on this branch](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/README.md)"

msgid "There is no `ActionSequence` / `actions.MoveJ` / `CustomAction` API. Skills are **registered names** in YAML (`task_queue` → `skill`). Full parameter docs: [docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md)."
msgstr "没有 `ActionSequence` / `actions.MoveJ` / `CustomAction` 这类 API。技能是 YAML 里的**注册名**（`task_queue` → `skill`）。完整参数说明见 [docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/SKILLS_REFERENCE.md)。"

msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

msgid "In the [lerobot_ros2](4-lerobot_ros2.md) monorepo this package:"
msgstr "在 [lerobot_ros2](4-lerobot_ros2.md) 单体仓库中，本包承担："

msgid "**Motion layer (`motion_generation`)** — turns task geometry and robot constraints into `StageTarget` sequences and executes them via `ROS2RobotInterface` (Cartesian, dual-arm sync, MoveJ, and so on)."
msgstr "**运动层（`motion_generation`）**：把任务几何与机器人约束变成 `StageTarget` 序列，并通过 `ROS2RobotInterface` 执行（笛卡尔 / 双臂同步 / MoveJ 等）。"

msgid "**Orchestration layer (`task_runtime`)** — runs a `task_queue` (YAML block list) through the skill registry and runtime context; merges `skill_defaults` / `skill_params`."
msgstr "**编排层（`task_runtime`）**：用技能注册表与运行时上下文执行 `task_queue`（YAML 块列表）；合并 `skill_defaults` / `skill_params`。"

msgid "**Around the edges** — Isaac Sim entity poses, sim reset, optional LeRobot recording."
msgstr "**周边**：Isaac Sim 实体位姿、仿真 reset、可选的 LeRobot 录制。"

msgid "It does **not** implement OCS2 / MPC or the Nav2 servers themselves; those stay behind existing ROS 2 interfaces. Pure motion/queue paths depend on `ROS2RobotInterface` (`ctx.interface`), not the LeRobot `ROS2Robot` class."
msgstr "本包**不**实现 OCS2 / MPC 或 Nav2 服务器本体；它们仍走已有 ROS 2 接口。纯运动/队列路径只依赖 `ROS2RobotInterface`（`ctx.interface`），不依赖 LeRobot 的 `ROS2Robot` 类。"

msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "前置要求"

msgid "Same baseline as the lerobot_ros2 monorepo README:"
msgstr "与 lerobot_ros2 单体仓库 README 的基线一致："

msgid "**Python 3.12**"
msgstr "**Python 3.12**"

msgid "**ROS 2 Jazzy**, with the matching `install/setup.bash` (or overlay) sourced so `rclpy` comes from that distro"
msgstr "**ROS 2 Jazzy**，并已 source 对应的 `install/setup.bash`（或 overlay），使 `rclpy` 来自该发行版"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

msgid "Typical path is from a **lerobot_ros2** checkout (composer is `submodules/robot_action_composer`):"
msgstr "典型路径是在 **lerobot_ros2** 检出中安装（composer 位于 `submodules/robot_action_composer`）："

msgid ""
"./init.sh all-motion          # interface + robot_action_composer\n"
"./init.sh install-lerobot     # extra: PyTorch + lerobot + plugins (record / infer)\n"
"# or once: ./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"./init.sh all-motion          # interface + robot_action_composer\n"
"./init.sh install-lerobot     # extra: PyTorch + lerobot + plugins (record / infer)\n"
"# or once: ./init.sh all"

msgid "Manual install, still from the monorepo root, after the env is active. Prefer **uv** and **`--no-deps`** so install does not pull `rclpy` from PyPI (see the lerobot_ros2 README):"
msgstr "手动安装仍在单体仓库根目录、环境已激活之后进行。推荐 **uv** 并加 **`--no-deps`**，避免从 PyPI 拉取 `rclpy`（见 lerobot_ros2 README）："

msgid ""
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional; grasp-generation UI"
msgstr ""
"uv pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer --no-deps\n"
"uv pip install \"viser>=0.2\"   # optional; grasp-generation UI"

msgid "The composer README also shows `pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface` then `pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer`. Use that only inside the project venv; on Ubuntu, system `pip` hits PEP 668. Optional extras named in `pyproject.toml`: `[recording]` (LeRobot / `lerobot_robot_ros2`), `[grasp]` (`viser>=0.2`)."
msgstr "composer README 也写了 `pip install -e submodules/ros2_robot_interface` 再 `pip install -e submodules/robot_action_composer`。只在项目虚拟环境内使用；Ubuntu 上系统 `pip` 会碰到 PEP 668。`pyproject.toml` 中的可选 extra：`[recording]`（LeRobot / `lerobot_robot_ros2`）、`[grasp]`（`viser>=0.2`）。"

msgid "Console scripts after install: `motion-generation`, `ros2-stack`, `grasp-generation`, `check-isaac-pose`, `check-robot-status`."
msgstr "安装后可用的控制台脚本：`motion-generation`、`ros2-stack`、`grasp-generation`、`check-isaac-pose`、`check-robot-status`。"

msgid "Layers"
msgstr "分层"

msgid "**`motion_generation`** — what each motion segment looks like and how it is sent."
msgstr "**`motion_generation`**：每一段运动长什么样、怎么发到机器人。"

msgid "`sequence/` — `StageTarget` / `ArmTarget` / `ArmStage`, builders such as `build_single_arm_pick_sequence`, and `execute_stage_sequence` (calls `ROS2RobotInterface`, wait-for-arrival, gripper timing)."
msgstr "`sequence/`：`StageTarget` / `ArmTarget` / `ArmStage`，以及 `build_single_arm_pick_sequence` 等 builder，还有 `execute_stage_sequence`（调用 `ROS2RobotInterface`、到位等待、夹爪节拍）。"

msgid "`tasks/` — geometry wrappers on top of that (handover, bimanual carry, parallel pick, drawer, pick/place, MoveJ return used by dataset recording)."
msgstr "`tasks/`：在 sequence 之上的几何封装（交接、双臂搬运、并行抓取、抽屉、抓放、数据集录制用的 MoveJ 返回）。"

msgid "**`task_runtime`** — which skills run, in what order, with which merged params."
msgstr "**`task_runtime`**：按队列调用哪些技能、顺序如何、合并后的参数是什么。"

msgid "`runner.run_task_queue` — connect → FSM → optional env reset → `QueueRuntimeContext` → each `task_queue` block (`ParallelSpec` allowed) → `get_skill` → `execute_stage_sequence`."
msgstr "`runner.run_task_queue`：连接机器人 → FSM → 可选环境 reset → 构造 `QueueRuntimeContext` → 顺序执行 `task_queue` 各块（支持 `ParallelSpec`）→ `get_skill` → `execute_stage_sequence`。"

msgid "`registry.py` — `register_skill(name, fn)` / `get_skill(name)`; unknown names raise `KeyError` listing registered skills."
msgstr "`registry.py`：`register_skill(name, fn)` / `get_skill(name)`；未知技能名会抛出 `KeyError`（错误信息含已注册名列表）。"

msgid "Each skill: `(ctx, params) -> (list[StageTarget], ExecutionMeta)`. Blocks with no Cartesian stages return an empty list (pure nav, pure MoveJ, side-effect-only)."
msgstr "每个技能签名：`(ctx, params) -> (list[StageTarget], ExecutionMeta)`。无笛卡尔阶段的块返回空列表（纯导航、纯 MoveJ、仅副作用）。"

msgid "YAML discovery scans `task_configs/**/*.yaml` and `robots/*/` (optional vendor grouping `robots/<Vendor>/<Robot>/`). See [docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md) and [docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md)."
msgstr "YAML 发现会扫描 `task_configs/**/*.yaml` 与 `robots/*/`（可选一层厂商分组 `robots/<Vendor>/<Robot>/`）。见 [docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/TASK_CONFIG_YAML.md) 与 [docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_action_composer/blob/feature/dex-grasp-generator/docs/ROBOT_CONFIG.md)。"

msgid "Skills (registered names)"
msgstr "技能（注册名）"

msgid "Do not invent a Python `MoveJ` / `GripperOpen` action class. YAML blocks set `skill:` to a **registered name**. Categories (examples from the README index; parameters live in SKILLS_REFERENCE):"
msgstr "不要发明 Python 版 `MoveJ` / `GripperOpen` Action 类。YAML 块把 `skill:` 写成**注册名**。分类（示例来自 README 索引；参数见 SKILLS_REFERENCE）："

